{
  "name": "Grenade, Fragmentation",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "value": "<p>As an action, you can throw a grenade at a point up to 60 feet away, or propel it with a Grenade Launcher to a point up to 1,000 feet away. It explodes at that point, creating its effect in a 20-foot-radius Sphere.</p><p>Each creature in the Sphere makes a DC 15 Dexterity saving throw, taking 17 (5d6) Piercing damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.</p><p><strong>Availability.</strong> This explosive can’t typically be bought. If explosives can be bought, treat them as Rare magic items.</p>"
